 "world_height_definition": "PROPOSED by Mainstay AP (cc:78faa10e), art lead, 2026-11-10 re-cut; Mala's confirmation asked. A person (the Warden) = 1.0 and the idle's alpha height is drawn at world_height x a person's height. Chosen from qa-evidence/lineup-size-options.png: at 1.0 the standing tiger's head is at the Warden's head and its body is 1.5 persons long, already larger than a real tiger; at 1.5 (class large) it is about 4 m long. 'person' is the class of its HEIGHT only; the long body is carried by the footprint.",
